  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "The YES BANK Wellness Plus Credit Card covers a distinct lifestyle category—health and wellness. The card is offered by YES BANK in collaboration with Aditya Birla Wellness Private Limited and is a premium variant of another card offered in this association—the YES BANK Wellness Credit Card. Though the type of benefits covered are similar, with the Plus variant the extent is higher. You get benefits around annual health check-ups, round-the-clock doctor or counselor helplines, in-studio or home-based workout sessions, and personalized diet plans. Based on its features around health check-ups and accelerated rewards at chemist/pharmaceutical stores, it comes in close competition with the Apollo SBI Credit Card Select, which comes at a similar fee and offers co-branded benefits with the Apollo network. If you have regular medical expenses and would also like to earn rewards on your medicine-related purchases, the YES BANK Wellness Plus card can be a good choice for you. However, if you think that you only need to go to the doctor once in a while and avail yourself of such complimentary benefits with your insurance plans, you could definitely get better options as per your spending habits.",
