        "q": "What are the ways for YES Bank credit card bill payment?",
        "a": "You can pay your YES Bank credit card bill via both offline and online modes through NEFT/IMPS/RTGS, Cash/Cheque/Demand Draft, Net Banking, YES Pay App. Existing Yes Bank account holders can also use ATM fund transfer and standing instructions facility."
      },
      {
        "q": "How can I generate a YES Bank credit card PIN?",
        "a": "To generate your credit card PIN, login to YES Bank Net Banking account or visit the nearest YES Bank ATM."
      },
      {
        "q": "Will I get international lounge benefits with my YES Bank Wellness Plus Credit Card?",
        "a": "No. YES Bank Wellness Credit Card does not offer international lounge access to the users. However you can avail domestic lounge access up to 2 visits per quarter. This is applicable for primary cardholders only."
      },
      {
        "q": "How to Block YES Bank Wellness Plus Credit Card, if lost?",
        "a": "In case your YES Bank Credit Card is lost or stolen, you need to block your card immediately. For this send an SMS with text, BLKCC to number 9840909000 via your registered mobile number."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is the Instant EMI facility on the Wellness Plus Credit Card?",
        "a": "YES Bank provides the instant EMI privilege on this credit card. Via this facility, you can convert purchases above Rs. 2,500 into easy EMIs for a repayment tenure of 3 to 24 months. The interest rate charged on the EMIs range from 12% to 15% per annum."
      }
    ]
